{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Protect the Kittenpire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cats\u2019 ancient nemesis - the <strong>mice</strong> - have <strong>grown</strong> <strong>into</strong> towering <strong>giants</strong> after a potion experiment went terribly wrong.<br>Defend the Kittenpire from colossal mouse monsters across 5<strong>\u00a0unique biomes</strong> and <strong>50 challenging stages</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546930/extras/2e0e51112d293ec97b044f6c8742a29e.poster.avif?t=1772747277\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546930/extras/2e0e51112d293ec97b044f6c8742a29e.webm?t=1772747277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Deploy your Paws!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your purr-fect squad from <strong>28 upgradable characters</strong>, <strong>2 mighty heroes</strong>, and <strong>3 special ability units</strong>.<br>Strategically place them to hold back the endless mouse invasion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546930/extras/9996756b1926689b25706cb7fc7a03b5.poster.avif?t=1772747277\" width=1170 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546930/extras/9996756b1926689b25706cb7fc7a03b5.webm?t=1772747277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Upgrade their Fluff!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character can be upgraded through <strong>5 power levels</strong>.<br>Heroes and special units feature their own <strong>skill trees</strong>, so you can sharpen claws, boost whiskers, and prepare for every challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546930/extras/6404ff34c774bb08c0e2ab1824dc4c0d.poster.avif?t=1772747277\" width=1170 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546930/extras/6404ff34c774bb08c0e2ab1824dc4c0d.webm?t=1772747277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546930/extras/6404ff34c774bb08c0e2ab1824dc4c0d.mp4?t=1772747277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Conquer the Mouse Monsters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>40 enemy types</strong> and <strong>5 epic bosses</strong>.<br>Looking for a cozy catnap or a real claw-biting challenge?<br>Pick from <strong>3 difficulty levels</strong> to suit your mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546930/extras/43195643fcc4d81daa84ad8034c99dc6.poster.avif?t=1772747277\" width=1170 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546930/extras/43195643fcc4d81daa84ad8034c99dc6.webm?t=1772747277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546930?t=1772747277","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546930?t=1772747277","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_